<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Selfcare Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Selfcare Inc raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Selfcare Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Said recent weakness in the shares &quot;has resulted in a valuation that provides very compelling risk/reward profile...&quot;</p>
<p>-- Sees significant room for capital appreciation over next 12-18 months.  Said a price target of $18 &quot;looks achievable.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to nine.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
